flowchart LR
  USER[ユーザー（中高生）] --> WEB[Next.js Static / Firebase Hosting]
  WEB <-->|端末内会話| LOCAL[(Memory / IndexedDB opt-in)]
  WEB --> AUTH[Firebase Auth]
  WEB -->|HTTPS /api/v1| DRF[DRF / Cloud Run]
  DRF -->|verify ID token| AUTH
  DRF --> DB[(PostgreSQL)]
  DRF --> JEV[Jev 評価候補]
  DRF --> DEEP[DeepSeek 対話表現]
  DRF --> ENGINE[Skill Executor / SymPy]
